        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86444, Trinity Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trinity Refrigerator Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. This modern refrigerator handle comes in a wide array of contemporary finishes. The sleek design makes the Trinity Refrigerator Pull a great choice for nearly any kind of decor. This Appliance Pull isn't just for use on fridges, it can be used on any standard appliance panel like the freezer and the dishwasher. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/trinity-cabinet-pull-emtek-86263\"><b> Trinity Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Trinity Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86444-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek Trinity Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86444:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86445:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
